      "journalName": "The Journal of biological chemistry",
      "name": "Bromodomain and extraterminal inhibitors block the Epstein-Barr virus lytic cycle at two distinct steps.",
      "pmid": "28588024",
      "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28588024/"
