      "abstract": "The United States President’s Emergency Plan for AIDS Relief (PEPFAR) is a U.S. government initiative dedicated to combating HIV/AIDS worldwide through treatment, prevention, and care programs. It represents the largest international commitment by any nation to fight a single disease.",
